13:["$","div",null,{"className":"prose-custom max-w-none","children":[["$","p","0",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["# Email Accessibility: Designing Inclusive Campaigns for All Subscribers"]}],["$","p","2",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["> *Email accessibility is not just a legal checkbox--it's an ethical responsibility and a proven business opportunity. When 1.3 billion people globally live with some form of disability (WHO, 2023), and 15-20% of email users rely on assistive technologies like screen readers, inaccessible emails aren't just exclusionary--they're leaving revenue, engagement, and brand trust on the table.*"]}],["$","h2","4",{"className":"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-[#FEF2F0] mt-10 mb-4 tracking-tight","children":"Why Email Accessibility Matters--Beyond Compliance"}],["$","p","6",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["Accessibility in email isn't about \"doing the right thing\" in the abstract--it's about reaching real people. Consider this:"]}],["$","p","8",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"26% of U.S. adults"}]," (61 million people) report having a disability (CDC, 2023), many of whom use email daily for shopping, banking, education, and healthcare communications."]}],["$","p","9",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- A 2022 Litmus State of Email Accessibility Report found that ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"91% of emails tested failed at least one WCAG 2.1 AA criterion"}],", with color contrast and missing alt text topping the list."]}],["$","p","10",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- Companies that prioritize accessibility see ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"up to 2.3× higher customer retention"}]," (Forrester, 2021)--and inclusive design lifts *all* users: captioned videos boost comprehension by 40% for neurodiverse and non-native speakers alike."]}],["$","p","12",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["Ignoring accessibility doesn't just risk ADA or EN 301 549 lawsuits--it alienates loyal customers, damages sender reputation, and dilutes campaign ROI."]}],["$","hr","14",{"className":"border-[#5F1E1E] my-8"}],["$","h2","16",{"className":"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-[#FEF2F0] mt-10 mb-4 tracking-tight","children":"Core WCAG Principles for Email Marketers"}],["$","p","18",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["The Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.1 AA standard is the gold standard--and yes, it applies to email. While email clients impose technical constraints (e.g., limited CSS support), WCAG's four foundational principles--",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Perceivable, Operable, Understandable, Robust (POUR)"}],"--are fully actionable."]}],["$","h3","20",{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-[#FEF2F0] mt-8 mb-3","children":"✅ Perceivable: Make content detectable by all senses"}],["$","p","21",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Color contrast"}],": Text must have a minimum contrast ratio of ",["$","strong","3",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"4.5:1"}]," against its background (WCAG 2.1 AA). Use tools like [WebAIM Contrast Checker](https://webaim.org/resources/contrastchecker/)--don't rely on visual judgment. *Actionable tip:* Avoid light gray text on white backgrounds (e.g., `#CCCCCC` on `#FFFFFF` = 1.7:1 -- *failing*). Instead, use `#333333` on white (14.8:1)."]}],"$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f","$L20","$L21","$L22","$L23","$L24","$L25","$L26","$L27","$L28","$L29","$L2a","$L2b","$L2c","$L2d","$L2e","$L2f","$L30","$L31","$L32","$L33","$L34","$L35","$L36","$L37","$L38","$L39","$L3a","$L3b","$L3c","$L3d","$L3e"]}]
