17:["$","p","22",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Alt text for images"}],": Every meaningful image requires descriptive `alt` attributes--not \"image123.jpg\" or empty `alt=\"\"` (which signals *decorative*). For product emails: `<img src=\"blue-sneaker.jpg\" alt=\"Nike Air Zoom Pegasus 40 in navy blue, side view\">`."]}]
