21:["$","h3","34",{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-[#FEF2F0] mt-8 mb-3","children":"✅ Understandable & Robust: Clarity + compatibility"}]
22:["$","p","35",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Descriptive link text"}],": Never use \"Click here.\" Instead: \"Download the Q3 Accessibility Report (PDF, 2.1 MB)\". Screen readers announce links out of context--clarity is critical."]}]
23:["$","p","36",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Semantic HTML structure"}],": Use `<h1>`-`<h3>` headings (not `<div class=\"headline\">`). Nest them logically. Many email clients (Outlook, Apple Mail) honor heading semantics for screen reader navigation."]}]
24:["$","p","37",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Plain-text version"}],": Always include a plain-text alternative. It's required under CAN-SPAM *and* supports users with cognitive disabilities, low bandwidth, or legacy devices. Test it: Does your message retain meaning without images, colors, or layout?"]}]
25:["$","hr","39",{"className":"border-[#5F1E1E] my-8"}]
26:["$","h2","41",{"className":"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-[#FEF2F0] mt-10 mb-4 tracking-tight","children":"Screen Reader Optimization: Real-World Tactics"}]
27:["$","p","43",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["Screen readers (like NVDA, JAWS, VoiceOver) parse HTML--not visual design. Here's how to optimize:"]}]
28:["$","p","45",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"ARIA labels only when necessary"}],": Don't overuse `aria-label`. Prefer native semantics first (`<button>Shop Now</button>` > `<div role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Shop Now\">`)."]}]
29:["$","p","46",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Avoid text-in-image CTAs"}],": Screen readers can't read embedded text. If you must use banners, pair them with adjacent descriptive text and `alt` + `aria-labelledby`."]}]
2a:["$","p","47",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Test with real tools"}],": Run your email through:"]}]
2b:["$","p","48",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- [Wave Evaluation Tool](https://wave.webaim.org/) (for web previews)"]}]
2c:["$","p","49",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- VoiceOver (macOS/iOS) or NVDA (Windows) + Thunderbird or Outlook"]}]
2d:["$","p","50",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- Litmus' [Accessibility Checker](https://litmus.com/accessibility) (simulates screen reader output)"]}]
2e:["$","p","52",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["*Pro tip:* Record yourself navigating your email using only keyboard (Tab/Shift+Tab) and VoiceOver. If you get stuck--or hear \"link, link, link, image\"--it's time to refactor."]}]
2f:["$","hr","54",{"className":"border-[#5F1E1E] my-8"}]
30:["$","h2","56",{"className":"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-[#FEF2F0] mt-10 mb-4 tracking-tight","children":"The Business Case: Data You Can't Ignore"}]
31:["$","p","58",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- Emails optimized for accessibility see ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"22% higher click-through rates"}]," (Deque Systems, 2023) among users with disabilities--and improved readability lifts engagement across *all* segments."]}]
32:["$","p","59",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- 71% of disabled users will abandon a site/email if it's not accessible (Click-Away Pound Survey, 2022). For a list of 100,000, that's ~7,100 lost conversions per campaign."]}]
33:["$","p","60",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- Brands like Microsoft and Gov.UK report ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"30% faster support ticket resolution"}]," after adopting inclusive email patterns--because fewer users need to call or email for help navigating campaigns."]}]
34:["$","hr","62",{"className":"border-[#5F1E1E] my-8"}]
35:["$","h2","64",{"className":"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-[#FEF2F0] mt-10 mb-4 tracking-tight","children":"Your 5-Minute Accessibility Audit Checklist"}]
36:["$","p","66",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["Before hitting *send*, verify:"]}]
37:["$","p","68",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["1. ✅ All images have concise, descriptive `alt` text (or `alt=\"\"` if purely decorative)."]}]
38:["$","p","69",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["2. ✅ Text contrast passes 4.5:1 (check headers *and* body copy)."]}]
39:["$","p","70",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["3. ✅ No reliance on color alone (e.g., \"Required fields are red\" → add an asterisk *and* \"(required)\")."]}]
3a:["$","p","71",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["4. ✅ Links make sense out of context (\"Read our Privacy Policy\" not \"Click here\")."]}]
3b:["$","p","72",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["5. ✅ Plain-text version is enabled and accurately reflects core content."]}]
3c:["$","hr","74",{"className":"border-[#5F1E1E] my-8"}]
3d:["$","p","76",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["Inclusion isn't a feature--it's the foundation. When you design email for the edges (low vision, motor impairments, ADHD, dyslexia), you build resilience, clarity, and empathy into every pixel and paragraph. And in a world where attention is scarce and trust is fragile, that's not just ethical. It's your most powerful differentiator."]}]
3e:["$","p","78",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["Start small. Audit one campaign this week. Then iterate. Because the most accessible email isn't perfect--it's *possible*. And possible is where belonging begins."]}]
